ub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in master branch: 0c45ace151f25de2ca54fe7a46b6f077be32ba6f\n- reproducible in Godot Engine v4.4.dev5.official.9e6098432\n- reproducible in Godot v4.3-stable\n- reproducible on OpenGL API 3.3.0 NVIDIA 550.120 - Compatibility - Using Device: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU\n- reproducible on OpenGL API 4.6 (Core Profile) Mesa 23.2.1-1ubuntu3.1~22.04.2 - Compatibility - Using Device: Intel - Mesa Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2\n- reproducible on android: Qualcomm - Adreno (TM) 650\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS 22.04 - X11 - GLES3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (14 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn gl_compatibility mode the LightmapGI textures will sometimes be corrupted when using multiple lightmaps when geometry attached to both lightmaps is rendered to the same viewport.\n\nHiding the geometry from the 2nd scene resolves the issue.\nMoving the camera resolves the issue.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP. \n\nmax_fps is 1 to make it easier to debug each frame...\nMRP01: There is a camera that moves each frame between 'bad' and 'good' positions where the corruption does and does not occur. \nMRP02: One node's visibility is toggled each frame, which causes the issue to exhibit.\n\nThere is a check button that can toggle the visibility of the 2nd lightmap's geometry which also removes the corruption.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/132b3d9a-788c-48ed-b00e-c69f2347fe70\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/655f3bdc-9ca4-4955-b4e4-3ef199f91d04\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gl_compatibility-lightmapgi-bug_01.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17882067/gl_compatibility-lightmapgi-bug_01.zip)\n[gl_compatibility-lightmapgi-bug_02.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17888200/gl_compatibility-lightmapgi-bug_02.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99592/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99592/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}